This folder contains all the modifications I made on Lammps src. 

ATOM:

I modified atom.cpp in order to add new properties to the atoms (to handle self-propulation and learning).  . 
atom_vec_polar2D is an atom style that eases the work in 2D. 
atom_vec_learner is an atom style that enables social learning.
atom_vec_sap is an atom style that considers self propulsion, rotational diffusion and self alignment.

FIX:

fix_robot_learning initializes scores and parameters, then performs the social learning.
fix_controler links the active force to the sensors and weigths.
fix_self_alignment adds active force and active torque.
fix_selfbrownian2D adds diffusion and realizes the time integration

COMPUTE:

compute_poidsnn_atom is a function that returns a matrix with all the weights of the differents particles. It can be called in a dump_custom.  


